          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il protège son corps en l’entourant d’une mousse délicate. Malgré son apparence insouciante, ce Pokémon est en fait constamment à l’affût.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "y",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It protects its skin by covering its body in delicate bubbles. Beneath its happy-go-lucky air, it keeps a watchful eye on its surroundings.",
